{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01601","headline":"琴曲歌辞 幽涧泉 · 李白","name":"琴曲歌辞 幽涧泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂彼白石，弹吾素琴。\n幽涧愀兮流泉深，善手明徽高张清。\n心寂历似千古，松飕飀兮万寻。\n中见愁猨吊影而危处兮，呌秋木而长吟。\n客有哀时失志而听者，泪淋浪以沾襟。\n乃缉商缀羽，潺湲成音。\n吾但写声发情於妙指，殊不知此曲之古今。\n幽涧泉，鸣深林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}